	(text "J30 (SPTD 1,5/8-H-3,5, double-level push-in): lower level 1-8 = OUT1-8 (ULN2803A low side),\nupper level 9-16 = +12 V coil supply (F30). Each relay coil goes between OUTn and the +12 V\nterminal right above it. Max about 300 mA per output, 1.1 A total (F30)."
